      <p>where:</p>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold">&lt;pod_spec&gt;.yaml</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies the pod spec to use.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">verbose</dt>
