      <h2 id="nodes-cluster-resource-levels-job_nodes-cluster-resource-levels" class="group scroll-mt-20">Running the OpenShift Cluster Capacity Tool as a job inside a pod<a href="#nodes-cluster-resource-levels-job_nodes-cluster-resource-levels" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
